  "_apply_exact_orders.py and the brief builder were not read. Whether the builder check ran is INFERRED from word counts in the rulings and audits.",
  "The device_notes figures (15 of 31, 1 near a seam word) are regex measures and not a reading of those notes.",
  "Row-count and diff figures from e1 and e2 are EXTRACTED that the file says them and REPORTED that they are true, unless a check states MEASURED.",
